    descriptionEn: "'Indie rockism' is not an established musical genre: the word 'rockism' comes from music criticism, where it denotes the valuing of guitar rock, authenticity and bands that play their own songs. Applied to indie, it evokes independent rock attached to these values. The label therefore describes an attitude more than a specific sound.",
