    descriptionEn: "Malmö indie refers to independent rock and pop acts linked to Malmö, a large city in the south of Sweden, in the Scania region. The city faces Copenhagen and has been joined to it by the Øresund Bridge since 2000, making it a crossroads between Sweden and Denmark. The label remains loose and mostly covers melodic guitars, soft vocals and often home-made production, in the tradition of indie rock and indie pop.",
